This package combines Lenovo's Intel Ethernet firmware bundle with Intel's
FreeBSD NVMUpdate utility.  It retains all 31 entries in Lenovo's
configuration, including X550, X710, XXV710, X722, I350, and I210 entries.
Some I350 and I210 entries update only the option ROM, exactly as supplied by
Lenovo.

Use nvmupdate-i210-i350-x550-700series-lenovo.
